  "bio": "Aurel Rond'l is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Dinan, France, specializing in 'newschool' and 'illustrative' styles. With vast experience and unmatched attention to detail, they've made notable appearances at prestigious events like the @nantestattooconvention, @tattooplanetarium, and @bxlstattooconvention. Clients may contact them via their email, 'dencreetdecuir@gmail.com,' for appointment enquiries.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Dinan, Brittany, France"
